      <Placemark>
        <name>Shady Acres (3B8)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7Gfe9n6pjWthFgu_Jd4oDqPT6sm13NK9wRbSHbsLOpl4hlTiUtJNxwRdJNgTTbbx6WSphUtGuj1ryjBNLrh3m0X6kCPRdJIr9KeM7-gHAaLJyUKZ5S8zWqheiBPUt1ndA5i1_oVXgu3tZMj93KYCYXFEMo3ZkxBzNLwONc3dQq9QSQWbaKYc8kwaiytkvV3Fzuri-K4ITa0No?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Address: 4409 208th St. E, Spanaway, WA  98387<br>Lat / Long: 47.0703889, -122.3710833<br>Stamp Location: Driving or biking?  Please avoid the private property.  Where to park?  Across from 208th St.  1. Walk down edge of grass airstrip that is on east side of asphalt runway.  Stay on edge, as planes land on grass airstrip.  It is on same side as Shady Acres sign.  2. Walk to right of sign.   3. Mowed area next to the driveway is the parking area.  Mailbox is on East side of field, by single standing fir tree mid field.<br>Region: Olympic<br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7Eoqom1UWv5mHVz34ZfDyVkpRsxpq80ZJ0PccTdA3hKpgni53otAxqYmwDCwVtktcAW_okMmrLStamTGWJaYpK0DgOwcJyZ5ER5SUFiu3UefH377u2wbtDborxbIVjNvtC8J_IhbCXNf6QaMK4HFprIkXI16pItnPZkDLKo-f3HvuAYSjVmI2dhn_Pe7TtQ6Dy3_9PPoIwYSM?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR4vjTYZ08EY7J4eGqAyZiOM82zY0Yk-zo-4C8OlK_Ynyj744Ys-2P8xAbuV2tMi4ovThTE5iEHlmPxNuH9kkuls-ykR1pHei3q1GqLXa9tzDCjWLG9OwpeTB9CCxX15U0j14rifx0bRIQoAD9JZHPLUBvhGjBsybl501yYlPmYEXH_CkeCMzEZO6y4yzNO_NzbInOXmbOZT4g?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR6_WYlIYA2j_usDDzTjYnS48-N7qP3D6VmTG_hNIZUCHvzpLmY8ErFRXXBy6_Q9zqAvdL-R6E9n-czFQhbU4pbdnS7OoREMuJhuE4NkjEw1gPFkXE-3OtKD3GgbNZSzBzaRmqW2F6mMj_Mn-rd5RcgepO-amgtkES1JKvelVGGk_1kVKgGDbzKqa1iiER8ZJ0q1bmBQN8X9Iw?fife=s16383" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br><img src="https://mymaps.usercontent.google.com/hostedimage/m/*/3AAjQbR7b14zH4oPvLkKvsGy5VLGhuEf49aJ1au4sHLPdDxeJiHC