      <Placemark>
        <name>Copalis (S16)</name>
        <description><![CDATA[Address: 2 miles NW of Copalis, WA<br>Lat / Long: 47.144664, -124.189073<br>Stamp Location: Lat/Long is estimated and should not be used for pre-flight planning or navigational purposes.  There is no stamp on site due to ongoing theft. Participants should take a photo of themselves at the airport for validation. When validating your passport at Auburn airport, participants will have an opportunity to receive a Copalis stamp at that time. <br>Region: Olympic]]></description>
